#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A short guide on integrating Qiskit into an external provider's quantum "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Panduan ringkas tentang mengintegrasikan Qiskit ke dalam sumber kuantum "
"pembekal luar."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integrate external quantum resources with Qiskit"
msgstr "Cipta pembekal"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Integrate external quantum resources with Qiskit {#integrate-external-"
"quantum-resources-with-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Integrasikan sumber kuantum luar dengan Qiskit {#integrate-external-quantum-"
"resources-with-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit SDK is built to support third parties in creating external "
"providers of quantum resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"SDK Qiskit dibina untuk menyokong pihak ketiga dalam mencipta pembekal luar "
"bagi sumber kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This means that any organization that develops or deploys quantum compute "
"resources can integrate their services into Qiskit and tap into its "
"userbase.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini bermakna mana-mana organisasi yang membangun atau menggunakan sumber "
"pengkomputeran kuantum boleh mengintegrasikan perkhidmatan mereka ke dalam "
"Qiskit dan memanfaatkan pangkalan penggunanya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Doing so requires creating a package that supports requests for quantum "
"compute resources and returns them to the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Melakukannya memerlukan penciptaan pakej yang menyokong permintaan sumber "
"pengkomputeran kuantum dan mengembalikannya kepada pengguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, the package must allow users to submit jobs and retrieve their"
" results through an implementation of the `qiskit.primitives` objects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, pakej tersebut mesti membolehkan pengguna menghantar kerja dan "
"mendapatkan semula keputusan mereka melalui pelaksanaan objek "
"`qiskit.primitives`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Providing access to backends {#providing-access-to-backends}"
msgstr "Menyediakan akses kepada Backend {#providing-access-to-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order for users to transpile and execute `QuantumCircuit` objects using "
"external resources, they need to instantiate an object containing a "
"[`Target`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) which provides "
"information about a QPU's constraints such as its connectivity, basis gates,"
" and number of qubits. This can be provided through an interface similar to "
"the [`QiskitRuntimeService`](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-"
"service) through which a user can make requests for a QPU. This object "
"should, at minimum, contain a `Target`, but a simpler approach would be to "
"return a [`BackendV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk pengguna melakukan transpilasi dan melaksanakan objek `QuantumCircuit`"
" menggunakan sumber luar, mereka perlu menginstankan objek yang mengandungi "
"[`Target`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) yang memberikan maklumat "
"tentang kekangan QPU seperti ketersambungannya, Gate asas, dan bilangan "
"Qubit. Ini boleh disediakan melalui antara muka yang serupa dengan "
"[`QiskitRuntimeService`](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service) "
"yang membolehkan pengguna membuat permintaan untuk QPU. Objek ini sekurang-"
"kurangnya perlu mengandungi `Target`, tetapi pendekatan yang lebih mudah "
"ialah mengembalikan instans "
"[`BackendV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "An example implementation may look something like:\n"
msgstr "Contoh pelaksanaan mungkin kelihatan seperti:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Providing an interface for execution {#providing-an-interface-for-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan antara muka untuk pelaksanaan {#providing-an-interface-for-"
"execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to providing a service returning hardware configurations, a "
"service providing access to external QPU resources also might also support "
"the execution of quantum workloads. Exposing that capability can be done by "
"creating implementations of the Qiskit primitives interfaces; for example "
"the [`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob), "
"[`BaseEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseEstimatorV2) and "
"[`BaseSamplerV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseSamplerV2) among "
"others. At minimum, these interfaces should be able to provide a method for "
"execution, querying job status, and returning the job results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain menyediakan perkhidmatan yang mengembalikan konfigurasi perkakasan, "
"perkhidmatan yang menyediakan akses kepada sumber QPU luar mungkin juga "
"menyokong pelaksanaan beban kerja kuantum. Mendedahkan keupayaan tersebut "
"boleh dilakukan dengan mencipta pelaksanaan antara muka primitif Qiskit; "
"contohnya "
"[`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob), "
"[`BaseEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseEstimatorV2) dan "
"[`BaseSamplerV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseSamplerV2) antara "
"lain. Sekurang-kurangnya, antara muka ini perlu menyediakan kaedah untuk "
"pelaksanaan, menanya status kerja, dan mengembalikan keputusan kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To handle job status and results, the Qiskit SDK provides a "
"[`DataBin`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin), "
"[`PubResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult), "
"[`PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult), and "
"[`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob) "
"objects should be used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengendalikan status kerja dan keputusan, SDK Qiskit menyediakan objek"
" [`DataBin`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin), "
"[`PubResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult), "
"[`PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult), dan "
"[`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob) yang "
"perlu digunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the `qiskit.primitives` [API documentation](../api/qiskit/primitives) as"
" well as the reference implementations "
"[`BackendEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2) "
"and [`BackendSampleV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2) "
"for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat [dokumentasi API](../api/qiskit/primitives) `qiskit.primitives` serta "
"pelaksanaan rujukan "
"[`BackendEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2) "
"dan [`BackendSampleV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2) "
"untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

